{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_018FG82Vgb4fwUJAkFV2vcds","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t# 0024: Keys that do not parse fail through redrive\n2\t\n3\tStub: write the full record from the design doc section below, using 0000-template.md.\n4\t\n5\t- **Status:** Accepted\n6\t- **Date:** 2026-10-20 (settled with the team, differs from the design doc)\n7\t- **Design doc section:** The \"Key doesn't parse\" row in Errors and retries (Processor and DynamoDB index, p.29 to p.32)\n8\t\n9\t## Decision (summary)\n10\t\n11\tA key that does not parse fails like any other record. The message is not deleted, and after 5 receives the redrive policy moves it to the DLQ. The design doc sends it straight to the DLQ, which needs sqs:SendMessage on the DLQ, a permission the processor's role does not have.\n12\t\n13\t## Rules for agents\n14\t\n15\tCode never sends to the DLQ.\n16\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"100b7837-8af6-48c8-8756-34b38cd069ea","uuid":"9e502415-c4a7-4395-9aa9-3e1042e1e1d1","timestamp":"2026-10-27T18:46:34.257Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/private/var/folders/hq/3cj1j26n6m7cd0qtmj18nmz40000gp/T/herd-bench-before-w_2widhh/docs/architecture/decisions/0024-unparseable-keys-fail-through-redrive.md","content":"# 0024: Keys that do not parse fail through redrive\n\nStub: write the full record from the design doc section below, using 0000-template.md.\n\n- **Status:** Accepted\n- **Date:** 2026-10-20 (settled with the team, differs from the design doc)\n- **Design doc section:** The \"Key doesn't parse\" row in Errors and retries (Processor and DynamoDB index, p.29 to p.32)\n\n## Decision (summary)\n\nA key that does not parse fails like any other record. The message is not deleted, and after 5 receives the redrive policy moves it to the DLQ. The design doc sends it straight to the DLQ, which needs sqs:SendMessage on the DLQ, a permission the processor's role does not have.\n\n## Rules for agents\n\nCode never sends to the DLQ.\n","numLines":16,"startLine":1,"totalLines":16}}}
